#. type: Title ####
#: _pages/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "What payment methods can I use to donate?"
msgstr "Koje načine plaćanja mogu koristiti za donacije?"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/donate.md
msgid "Open Collective, Liberapay, and direct bank transfer."
