#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issues"
msgstr "Problemi"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you come across an issue regarding F-Droid, please report it to the related issue tracker."
msgstr "Ako naiđeš na problem vezan uz F-Droid, prijavi ga na odgovarajući sustav za praćenje problema."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client App"
msgstr "Klijentska aplikacija"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you’re having a problem with the F-Droid client application (our app store app), please check if we already know about it, and/or report it in [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)."
msgstr "Ako imaš problem s F-Droid klijentskom aplikacijom (našom aplikacijom za trgovinu aplikacija), provjeri je li za taj problem već znamo i/ili ga prijavi u [ovom sustavu za praćenje problema](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidclient/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "App Data"
msgstr "Podaci aplikacije"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For problems related to the contents of the F-Droid repository (the apps in our app store), such as a disappeared or outdated applications, please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)."
msgstr "Za probleme u vezi sa sadržajem F-Droid repozitorija (aplikacije u našoj trgovini aplikacija), kao što su npr. nestale ili zastarjele aplikacije, koristi [ovaj sustav za praćenje problema](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroiddata/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Request for Packaging"
msgstr "Zatraži pakiranje"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "To request a new application to be packaged (add an app to our app store), please, first check the app data issue tracker to see if that application was available in the past and got removed. Any remaining request for packaging (RFP) can be added to [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues/)."
msgstr "Za zahtjev za pakiranje nove aplikacije (dodavanje aplikacije u našu trgovinu aplikacija) najprije provjeri sustav za praćenje problema s podacima aplikacije. Tamo možeš pregledati je li ta aplikacija u prošlosti bila dostupna i je li uklonjena. Svi preostali zahtjevi za pakiranje (RFP) mogu se dodati u [ovaj sustav za praćenje problema](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/rfp/-/issues/)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server Tools"
msgstr "Alati servera"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues on the server tools (building apps yourself or running your own repo), please use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)."
msgstr "Za probleme s alatima servera (samostalna izrada aplikacija ili pokretanje vlastitog repozitorija), koristi [ovaj sustav za praćenje problema](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroidserver/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website"
msgstr "Web-stranica"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to this web site, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)."
msgstr "Za probleme vezane uz ovu web-stranicu možeš koristiti [ovaj sustav za praćenje problema](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Website Search"
msgstr "Pretraga web-stranice"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "For issues relating to https://search.f-droid.org or search results in this website, you can use [this issue tracker](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website-search/issues)."
msgstr "Za probleme vezane uz https://search.f-droid.org ili rezultate pretraživanja na ovoj web-stranici koristiti [ovaj sustav za praćenje problema](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/fdroid-website-search/issues)."

#. type: Title ###
#: _pages/issues.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Fire Hose"
msgstr "Ogroman protok podataka"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/issues.md
msgid "If you have not found the right place, try searching through [all of the issues](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/)  tracked by the F-Droid project."
msgstr "Ako nisi pronašao/la pravo mjesto, pokušaj pretražiti [sve probleme](https://gitlab.com/groups/fdroid/-/issues/) koje prati F-Droid projekt."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repomaker"
msgstr "Repomaker"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "The F-Droid app store is essentially a collection of apps created by individuals all around the world. Collections of apps are also called repositories, or repos for short. So whether you are a musician who wants to publish their music or a developer who wants to serve nightly builds of their app, you can create your own repo and share it with other people independently of F-Droid.org."
msgstr "Trgovina F-Droid aplikacija je u biti zbirka aplikacija koje su stvorili pojedinci diljem svijeta. Zbirke aplikacija se takošer zovu repozitoriji. Svejedno je li glazbenici žele objavljivati svoju glazbu ili programeri žele objavljivati noćne verzije svoje aplikacije, svi mogu izraditi vlastiti repozitorij i dijeliti ga s drugima neovisno o F-Droid.org."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "In the past, creating a repo was difficult because you had to have knowledge of the command line, needed to know how to edit text files to edit your packages' store details and had to paste screenshots in a special system of directories to have them displayed inside the F-Droid app."
msgstr "U prošlosti je bilo teško izraditi repozitorij jer je bilo potrebno imati znanje o naredbenom retku, o uređivanju tekstualnih datoteka za uređivanje detalja paketa za trgovinu te su se snimke ekrana morale čuvati u posebnom sustavu direktorija kako bi se dobro prikazale unutar F-Droid aplikacije."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "This process is simplified thanks to Repomaker. Now you can create your own mini app store, using our simplified interface, guiding you through every step in the process."
msgstr "Ovaj je proces pojednostavljen zahvaljujući Repomakeru. Sada možeš stvoriti vlastitu mini trgovinu aplikacija koristeći naše pojednostavljeno sučelje koje te vodi kroz svaki korak u postupku."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "This all got easier now: with Repomaker, you are able to create your own repo and do not need to have any special knowledge to do so.  Check out the [installation guide](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation)  for information on how you can install Repomaker on your device."
msgstr "Sve je to sada postalo lakše: s Repomakerom se može izraditi vlastiti repozitorij bez posebnog znanja. Pogledaj [vodič za instalaciju](https://gitlab.com/fdroid/repomaker/blob/master/README.md#installation) za informacije o tome kako instalirati Repomaker na svoj uređaj."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
msgid "Try out the demo test instance <https://repomakerdemo.fdroid.net> and tell us what you think."
msgstr "Isprobaj demo testnu instancu <https://repomakerdemo.fdroid.net> i reci nam što misliš."

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Your repo can serve all types of media*\n"
msgstr ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/repo-details.png %})<br/>\n"
"*Tvoj repozitorij može posluživati sve vrste medija.*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: _pages/repomaker.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[![]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})]({% asset repomaker-screenshots/package-details.png %})<br/>\n"
